{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《紐約時報》報道，一名患有嚴重癲癇的31歲中國女子Bowen Wan，在與ChatGPT討論用藥後，按照聊天機械人提供的方案逐步減少抗癲癇藥物，最終被發現死於美國西雅圖的住所。其父母已於當地時間10月27日起訴OpenAI，指控ChatGPT提供危險用藥建議，鼓勵她向醫生隱瞞減藥計劃，並將異常症狀解釋為身體恢復過程中的積極變化。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584286.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.901455+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:43:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"6fbf3efb09d3ddb739bf762916ab34b2cfd63eed3b6fd068d8068ad61f926a78","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}